1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:02,712
Welcome back, adventurers!

2
00:00:02,662 --> 00:00:05,849
Today's story is: The Missing Thunderbolt.

3
00:00:05,849 --> 00:00:10,500
Way up above the soft white clouds, Little Zeus woke up with excitement.

4
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:15,000
He ate his twelve breakfast olives and searched for his golden thunderbolt.

5
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:18,237
Where did my favorite lightning thunderbolt go?

6
00:00:18,237 --> 00:00:20,774
Zeus asked with great worry.

7
00:00:20,774 --> 00:00:25,550
I saw a dark shadow flying near the mountaintop," Athena answered quickly.

8
00:00:25,550 --> 00:00:29,949
She adjusted her glasses and pointed toward the stormy western sky.

9
00:00:29,949 --> 00:00:34,212
The storm clouds look very angry today," she noted with caution.

10
00:00:34,212 --> 00:00:38,462
Little Zeus grabbed his tiny golden crown and ran toward the door.

11
00:00:38,462 --> 00:00:42,774
We need to find Baby Hercules right now," Zeus shouted loudly.

12
00:00:42,774 --> 00:00:46,162
He might know what happened to my missing thunderbolt.

13
00:00:46,162 --> 00:00:50,337
They found Baby Hercules playing in the sunny palace courtyard.

14
00:00:50,337 --> 00:00:54,487
The chubby baby boy was lifting a heavy stone pillar with ease.

15
00:00:54,487 --> 00:00:57,762
Did someone say we are going on an adventure?

16
00:00:57,762 --> 00:01:00,299
Hercules asked happily.

17
00:01:00,299 --> 00:01:03,887
He dropped the stone pillar and clapped his little hands.

18
00:01:03,887 --> 00:01:06,437
Someone took my thunderbolt...

19
00:01:06,437 --> 00:01:09,137
To be continued in Chapter 2!

